sequenceDiagram
    title Checkout
    autonumber
    actor U as Shopper
    participant W as Web app
    participant API
    participant DB as Orders DB
    U->>+W: Place order
    W->>+API: POST /orders
    Note right of API: validates the cart
    loop every item
        API->>DB: reserve stock
        DB-->>API: ok
    end
    alt card accepted
        API-)DB: write order
        API-->>W: 201 Created
    else card declined
        API--xW: 402 Payment required
    end
    opt receipt wanted
        W->>W: render receipt
    end
    par notify
        API--)U: email
    and log
        API->>API: audit
    end
    critical commit
        DB->DB: fsync
    option timeout
        DB-->API: retry
    end
    break out of stock
        API<<->>DB: release
    end
    deactivate API
    Note over U,W: done<br>thanks
    W-->>-U: Confirmation
